  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It'd be nice to have the ability to be able to make your own custom menu themes so that it's not just a  boring glowing blue menu, because most people are going to want to have like, an SAO menu, or something along those lines. Maybe even integrate a way to do this into the SDK, so all you'd need to do is add a custom material. I'm not sure how hard it is to do this seeing has when a player has his/her menu open, other players can't see it, but custom UI elements from what I can tell, can't be dynamically assigned to each player in it's own instance (at least not with this version of unity)",
